ntity","erdos1968_p226"],"evidence_ids":[],"id":"step.displacement_identity","kind":"claim","label":"The displacement identity (D)","locator":"Section 1, display (D), p. 2","source_id":"paper.short.pdf","statement":"For a positive integer $N$, $\\Delta_{b,A}(N)=\\sum_{a\\in A}\\frac{b^{N\\bmod a}-1}{b^a-1}=(b^N-1)X_A(b)-J_{b,A}(N)$ with $J_{b,A}(N)=\\sum_{a\\in A,\\,a\\le N}\\sum_{j=1}^{\\lfloor N/a\\rfloor}b^{N-ja}$. The identity follows on dividing $N$ by each $a$. At an integer base $J_{b,A}(N)$ is an integer.","status":"unverified"},"ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/step.displacement_identity","relations":[{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/step.positive_displacement","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22step.positive_displacement%22%2C%22step.displacement_identity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22step.positive_displacement%22%2C%22step.displacement_identity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/step.displacement_identity"},{"derived":false,"family":"arguments","from":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/step.rational_gap","id":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22step.rational_gap%22%2C%22step.displacement_identity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","kind":"supports","record_ref":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/edges/%5B%22step.rational_gap%22%2C%22step.displacement_identity%22%2C%22supports%22%5D","semantic_class":"curated_argument_support","to":"sha256:72b1b4c2b4a3766719310d7deb808e62432d8c1d3e4854b25b1285cbe6056696/nodes/step.displace